        "explanation": "Durbin explicitly claims personal actions that advanced the airport project: 'I helped secure an expedited environmental review' and 'facilitated the return of the project to the national priority list for federal funding.'"
      },
      {
        "document_id": "1747",
        "explanation": "The Senate approved 'legislation by Sen. Byrd' boosting Youth ChalleNGe funding, and the release notes he worked to create the program in 1991 — claimed legislative authorship plus a funding outcome."
      }
    ]
  }
}
